      "title": "CPU exhaustion in SvelteKit remote form deserialization (experimental only)",
      "summary": "Versions of `@sveltejs/kit` prior to 2.52.2 with remote functions enabled are vulnerable to CPU exhaustion. Malformed form data can cause the server to become unresponsive while processing a request, resulting in denial of service.\n\nOnly applications using both `experimental.remoteFunctions` and `form` are vulnerable.",
